  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 439
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 据说上古神兽玄武乃龟蛇之身，但龟体与蛇体其实并非一体，而是一种共生的关系。由于龟的寿元比蛇要长的多，在蛇寿元将近之时，便主动离开了龟。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114184493576459710}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
