  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 401
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 啧啧，可惜这种晶体中的能量似乎只有鲲族能够吸收，对于人类修士而言只能算是一种收藏品而已。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114184493576459710}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114170094018207163
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1540700027244256}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 496
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 远古时期，某一天的入夜时分，曾有一枚中空的银色圆环悬挂在远空中，整片无尽之海很快便充满了阴气。灵气也变得异常躁动，向无尽之海深处涌去。这异象足足持续了一整晚，直到第二天天亮才消失。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114184493576459710}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114068340560066505
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1540700027244256}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 520
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 曾有一人在好奇心驱使下接近过那黑色人影——他先用神识探查了一番，发现神识压根探测不到他体内。后又试图与他交流，发现他发音虽然奇怪，但确实能够口吐人言。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114184493576459710}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
